## Frequently asked questions

### Do you write compliant financial promotions?

No. I write and structure SEO content for financial advisers and your compliance team decides what is approved for publication. I work to their edits and keep a record of each approval.

### Do I need a retainer after the audit?

No. The £495 financial adviser SEO audit stands alone and you can implement the actions with your own team or web developer. The £495 is credited against your first month when a retainer starts within 60 days of delivery.

### How long does financial adviser SEO take?

Financial adviser SEO usually takes several months for local pack and content gains. Technical fixes can be in place within weeks of the audit. Competition in your area sets the pace.

My guide on [how long SEO takes](/blog/how-long-does-seo-take/) explains the main factors.

### Can you measure our share of AI answers against competitors?

Yes. My £1,500 AI visibility audit measures your firm's share of AI answers against three agreed competitors on an agreed set of buyer questions. Results vary between runs. I report them as observed on the day.

